# HEE v4: process learnings from HEE-v2/v3 (planning input)

**Written:** 2026-10-01. **Mode:** planning only. Every source was read-only; this file is the only write. No cargo, builds, git writes or kills.
**Tags:** **FACT** means a number or quote found at the cited path:line. **INTERP** means my inference from facts. **UNMEASURED** means no source measured it.
**Lineage:** one author (Opus 5.5), synthesising same-lineage records. This is the weakest kind of evidence (`~/CLAUDE.md` §5 "Never self-certify"). No claim here was re-measured against the v3 tree except the counts marked *(measured now)*.

